{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":32,"count":29,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L07-3-05\",\"开车\",\"開車\",\"开车\",\"V-sep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"從我家到機場也不遠，開車去、坐捷運去都可以。","pinyin":"Cóng wǒ jiā dào jīchǎng yě bù yuǎn, kāichē qù, zuò jiéyùn qù dōu kěyǐ.","english":"It is not far from my house to the airport. I can go by car or MRT.","sourceCardId":"B1L07-3-01","sourceFront":"線","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L08-2-21\",\"没关系\",\"沒關係\",\"没关系\",\"Ph\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"沒關係，我們可以下個週末再來看。對了，妳要買鞋子吧？","pinyin":"Méiguānxi, wǒmen kěyǐ xià ge zhōumò zài lái kàn. Duìle, nǐ yào mǎi xiézi ba?","english":"It’s okay; we can come again next weekend. By the way, you want to buy shoes, don’t you?","sourceCardId":"B1L08-2-01","sourceFront":"黃色","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L11-2-02\",\"以后\",\"以後\",\"以后\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我希望以後可以去他家玩。","pinyin":"Wǒ xīwàng yǐhòu kěyǐ qù tā jiā wán.","english":"I hope that in the future I can go to his house to have fun.","sourceCardId":"B1L11-2-02","sourceFront":"以後","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"考試開始以後，我們不可以跟同學說話。","pinyin":"Kǎoshì kāishǐ yǐhòu, wǒmen bù kěyǐ gēn tóngxué shuōhuà.","english":"After the exam starts, we cannot talk with classmates.","sourceCardId":"B1L12-1-10","sourceFront":"以後","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"下班以後，她常跟朋友一起去跑步。","pinyin":"Xiàbān yǐhòu, tā cháng gēn péngyǒu yìqǐ qù pǎobù.","english":"After getting off work, she often goes running with friends.","sourceCardId":"B1L12-1-17","sourceFront":"下班","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"下班以後，我常跟同事一起去吃晚飯。","pinyin":"Xiàbān yǐhòu, wǒ cháng gēn tóngshì yìqǐ qù chī wǎnfàn.","english":"After getting off work, I often go to eat dinner with colleagues.","sourceCardId":"B1L12-2-04","sourceFront":"同事","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"來台灣以後，每個週末我都有很多活動，覺得很開心。","pinyin":"Lái Táiwān yǐhòu, měi ge zhōumò wǒ dōu yǒu hěn duō huódòng, juéde hěn kāixīn.","english":"After coming to Taiwan, I have many activities every weekend and feel very happy.","sourceCardId":"B1L14-1-02","sourceFront":"活動","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"來台灣以後，我認識了很多國家的新朋友。","pinyin":"Lái Táiwān yǐhòu, wǒ rènshi le hěn duō guójiā de xīn péngyǒu.","english":"After coming to Taiwan, I have met many new friends from many countries.","sourceCardId":"B1L14-3-01","sourceFront":"國家","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他的計畫是畢業以後到美國去工作。","pinyin":"Tā de jìhuà shì bìyè yǐhòu dào Měiguó qù gōngzuò.","english":"His plan is to go to the United States to work after graduation.","sourceCardId":"B1L16-1-03","sourceFront":"計畫","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"哥哥洗澡以後都先喝一瓶牛奶再睡覺。","pinyin":"Gēge xǐzǎo yǐhòu dōu xiān hē yì píng niúnǎi zài shuìjiào.","english":"After my older brother takes a shower, he always first drinks a bottle of milk and then goes to sleep.","sourceCardId":"B1L16-2-07","sourceFront":"洗澡","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"念了一個小時的書以後，你最好休息十分鐘。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L02-1-28","sourceFront":"念書","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這種藥很有用，吃了以後頭就不疼了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L02-1-32","sourceFront":"有用","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"下課以後，我要跟同學討論去日月潭旅行的事情。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-32","sourceFront":"討論","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"付了房租以後，你這個月的獎學金還剩多少？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-36","sourceFront":"剩","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"山本良介來台灣以後，搬了兩次家。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-2-16","sourceFront":"搬家","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次的旅遊真有意思，我以後還想多去幾個地方玩。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-2-07","sourceFront":"旅遊","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"請你想像一下，二十年以後，你的生活會怎麼樣？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-1-15","sourceFront":"想像","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他的英文、日文都很好，畢業以後想當翻譯。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-1-27","sourceFront":"翻","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他很煩惱，不知道畢業以後要找什麼工作。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-2-20","sourceFront":"煩惱","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"隔壁的王媽媽化妝以後，變年輕了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-22","sourceFront":"變","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"運動以後最好喝開水，不要喝太甜的飲料。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-38","sourceFront":"開水","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有了捷運以後，台北市的交通情況改善了很多。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-2-09","sourceFront":"改善","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有了捷運以後，台北市的交通情況改善了很多。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-2-10","sourceFront":"情況","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"孩子出國留學以後，父母發現孩子成長了不少。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-2-23","sourceFront":"成長","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"王教授退休以後，每個週末都去育幼院陪孩子讀書。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-1-31","sourceFront":"退休","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"爸爸下班以後，總是先洗個澡、喝個飲料，再吃晚飯。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-2-09","sourceFront":"個","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我參加了愛心服務社以後，想法比以前更成熟了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-2-14","sourceFront":"成熟","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"以凡學了中文以後，他覺得東方文化和西方文化很不一樣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-1-14","sourceFront":"東方","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"以凡學了中文以後，他覺得東方文化和西方文化很不一樣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-1-15","sourceFront":"西方","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"店員把這台咖啡機的特色說明得非常清楚，聽了他的說明以後，大家都很感興趣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-13","sourceFront":"說明","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個城市的空氣變乾淨了，主要是因為有捷運以後，開車的人比以前少了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-1-25","sourceFront":"主要","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那場強烈地震發生以後，許多國家的專業人員都來救災，讓人非常感動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-22","sourceFront":"救災","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小畢本來認為自己的書法寫得很好，但是上次比賽輸了以後，他就失去自信了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-14","sourceFront":"自信","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"李小姐結婚以後的生活重心就是家庭，尤其是照顧剛出生的小孩。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-01","sourceFront":"尤其","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那家工廠自從改善了設備以後，生產速度就一天比一天快了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-01","sourceFront":"自從","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"下課以後，老師幫我一對一補習數學，希望我的期末考會及格","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-11","sourceFront":"對","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"不少人批評那家健身中心教練的教學品質很差，以後絕對不會再去了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-09","sourceFront":"批評","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有關這場火災的詳細情況，等調查結果出來以後，市長會向民眾報告。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-31","sourceFront":"有關","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"姊姊有了自己的孩子以後，才體會到當父母是很辛苦的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-24","sourceFront":"體會","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這種鬧鐘有點特別，響了以後得按三下才能關掉。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-12","sourceFront":"按","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"自從有了抽號機以後，人們就不需要站著排隊了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-13","sourceFront":"抽號機","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"吃了健康食品以後，還是得經常運動才能擁有好身材。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-19","sourceFront":"食品","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"註了冊以後，新生要把相關證件各影印一份，交給學校。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-38","sourceFront":"各","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"食品罐頭吃完以後把罐子洗乾淨，就可以回收了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-09","sourceFront":"罐頭","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他從音樂學院畢業以後就加入歌劇團，到世界各地表演。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-03","sourceFront":"歌劇","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"自從他改變飲食習慣以後，就變得既健康又有活力。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-30","sourceFront":"活力","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"自從住校以後，我得學習自己收拾、整理房間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-58","sourceFront":"收拾","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"知道自己誤會別人以後，最好早一點兒跟對方道歉。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-2-14","sourceFront":"誤會","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"考完試以後，我們去海洋公園開開心心地玩一場吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-07","sourceFront":"場","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有些事明明不對，卻因沒人敢說，久了以後就被社會接受了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-13","sourceFront":"明明","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他想等中文程度達到高級以後，就來臺灣念大學。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-01","sourceFront":"高級","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"自從開始掉頭髮以後，醫師就建議他每天吃半顆維他命。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-32","sourceFront":"顆","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L11-3-13\",\"出去\",\"出去\",\"出去\",\"Vi\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"A:你現在有空嗎？ B:我現在要跟太太出去，晚上再給你打電話。","pinyin":"A: Nǐ xiànzài yǒu kòng ma? B: Wǒ xiànzài yào gēn tàitai chūqù, wǎnshàng zài gěi nǐ dǎ diànhuà.","english":"A: Are you free now? B: I'm going out with my wife now; I'll call you again in the evening.","sourceCardId":"B1L11-3-13","sourceFront":"出去","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":1},{"chinese":"A:今天天氣很好，你怎麼沒出去？ B:今天我有很多功課，不能出去玩。","pinyin":"A: Jīntiān tiānqì hěn hǎo, nǐ zěnme méi chūqù? B: Jīntiān wǒ yǒu hěn duō gōngkè, bù néng chūqù wán.","english":"A: The weather is so nice today; how come you didn't go out? B: I have a lot of homework today, so I can't go out and have fun.","sourceCardId":"B1L12-1-02","sourceFront":"怎麼","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我已經坐了四、五個小時了，想出去走走！","pinyin":"Wǒ yǐjīng zuò le sì, wǔ gè xiǎoshí le, xiǎng chūqù zǒuzou!","english":"I have already been sitting for four or five hours, I want to go out and walk around!","sourceCardId":"B1L14-1-17","sourceFront":"坐","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"晚上的風很舒服，我們一起出去走走吧。","pinyin":"Wǎnshang de fēng hěn shūfu, wǒmen yìqǐ chūqù zǒuzou ba.","english":"The evening wind is very comfortable; let's go out for a walk together.","sourceCardId":"B1L16-2-11","sourceFront":"風","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"晚上我有事，要出去一下。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L01-1-04","sourceFront":"一下","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我討厭下雨，因為出去玩很不方便。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-1-31","sourceFront":"討厭","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"大家都出去了，還好我帶了鑰匙。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L05-2-06","sourceFront":"還好","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我跟妹妹的興趣不同，她喜歡出去運動，我喜歡在家聽音樂。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-1-01","sourceFront":"不同","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個週末我得在家做一份報告，不能出去玩。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-1-23","sourceFront":"報告","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他不敢約女生出去，或許是因為太害羞了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-2-03","sourceFront":"或許","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在你的國家，成年的孩子常跟父母住在一起，還是滿十八歲就搬出去了？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-11","sourceFront":"成年","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"姊姊：下個星期就要大學考試了，你怎麼不用功念書，反而天天出去玩？ 弟弟：妳別管我，這是我自己的事。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-14","sourceFront":"管","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我剛剛忘了把垃圾拿出去丟，還好你提醒我。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-11","sourceFront":"提醒","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家店面的租金太高，所以一直租不出去。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-04","sourceFront":"店面","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他上課時偷偷出去拿了蛋糕進來，原來是要幫老師慶祝生日。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-24","sourceFront":"偷","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他做運動時手甩得太用力，把手錶都甩得飛出去了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-16","sourceFront":"甩","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他正在修改明天要交出去的計畫，你別去打擾他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-55","sourceFront":"打擾","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"出(exit) + 去(go) → to go out."},{"key":"[\"B1L12-2-02\",\"辛苦\",\"辛苦\",\"辛苦\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他每天早上去上班，晚上去上課，真辛苦！","pinyin":"Tā měi tiān zǎoshang qù shàngbān, wǎnshang qù shàngkè, zhēn xīnkǔ!","english":"He goes to work every morning and goes to class in the evening; it's really tough!","sourceCardId":"B1L12-2-02","sourceFront":"辛苦","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"聽說這家工廠的工人都很辛苦，可是老闆給的錢不多。","pinyin":"Tīngshuō zhè jiā gōngchǎng de gōngrén dōu hěn xīnkǔ, kěshì lǎobǎn gěi de qián bù duō.","english":"I heard that the workers at this factory all work very hard, but the money the boss gives is not much.","sourceCardId":"B1L12-3-16","sourceFront":"工人","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":3},{"chinese":"那家工廠的工作很辛苦，可是錢很多，所以很多人願意做。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-41","sourceFront":"願意","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在我爺爺奶奶的年代，生活比較辛苦，不少窮人為了省錢，衣服破了還是繼續穿。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-24","sourceFront":"破","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"不管追求夢想的路上有多辛苦，都是我們一輩子珍貴的回憶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-13","sourceFront":"回憶","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小陳很孝順，每個週末都去安養院陪父親聊天、散步，一點兒都不覺得辛苦","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-23","sourceFront":"孝順","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"張太太一個人管三個孩子，家裡大大小小的事情也是她負責的，太辛苦了","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-14","sourceFront":"管","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"姊姊有了自己的孩子以後，才體會到當父母是很辛苦的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-24","sourceFront":"體會","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"開早餐店很辛苦，大清早老闆就得起來準備。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-02","sourceFront":"大清早","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那項新產品的設計圖你一個人負責太辛苦了，倒不如找同事一起來做。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-2-17","sourceFront":"倒不如","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"學校安排我們到鄉下當「一日農民」，體驗農夫的辛苦。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-40","sourceFront":"農民","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"射箭看來容易，但想把箭射好，就得辛苦地練習。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-12","sourceFront":"箭","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"辛(pungent) + 苦(bitter) → a life that tastes pungent and bitter: 辛苦(hard; tough)."},{"key":"[\"B1L14-3-06\",\"受伤\",\"受傷\",\"受伤\",\"Vp-sep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他因為打籃球的時候不小心，所以手受傷了。","pinyin":"Tā yīnwèi dǎ lánqiú de shíhòu bù xiǎoxīn, suǒyǐ shǒu shòushāng le.","english":"Because he was not careful when playing basketball, his hand got injured.","sourceCardId":"B1L14-3-06","sourceFront":"受傷","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我不喜歡踢足球，因為腳很容易受傷。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L01-2-17","sourceFront":"腳","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"大人應該把刀子放在安全的地方，要不然小孩子碰了，可能會受傷。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-23","sourceFront":"碰","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"為了避免皮膚受傷，夏天出門時別忘了戴上帽子和太陽眼鏡。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-22","sourceFront":"避免","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"地震時要保護自己的安全，最重要的是避免頭部受傷","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-01","sourceFront":"地震","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那位老先生走著走著，路旁的樹木突然倒了下來，他差一點就受傷了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-11","sourceFront":"旁","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"昨天晚上突然發生強烈地震，學校旁的那座橋塌了，還好沒人受傷。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-30","sourceFront":"塌","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:對不起，你的杯子被我打破了，我不是故意的。 B:沒關係！還好你沒受傷。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-07","sourceFront":"故意","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這條路不平，有民眾貼了海報，請大家走路時要小心，以免受傷。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-26","sourceFront":"以免","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"路邊的攝影機錄到了房先生發生車禍的經過，讓警察順利抓到了害他受傷的人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-02","sourceFront":"經過","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家醫院昨天半夜發生嚴重的火災，受傷的人數約有三十名。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-21","sourceFront":"人數","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"病人受傷的地方如果沒有好好處理，很容易會被感染。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-11","sourceFront":"感染","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"像足球、籃球那樣激烈的運動，常讓運動員的小腿、手、腳受傷。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-23","sourceFront":"小腿","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"賽跑前要先做點兒運動，免得受傷。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-42","sourceFront":"賽跑","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L02-1-15\",\"干\",\"乾\",\"干\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"是因為吃的東西不乾淨嗎？","pinyin":"Shì yīnwèi chī de dōngxi bù gānjìng ma?","english":"Is it because of having contaminated food?","sourceCardId":"B1L10-2-01","sourceFront":"咳嗽/咳","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L04-2-05\",\"擠\",\"擠\",\"挤\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"上下班的時候，捷運站有很多人，總是很擠。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-2-05","sourceFront":"擠","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"教授的房間堆滿了各種書籍，本來就不大的房間感覺更擠了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-25","sourceFront":"堆","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"電腦展內的人太多了，大家擠來擠去的，真是受不了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-19","sourceFront":"擠","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這處風景區非常有名，假日都擠滿了遊客。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-39","sourceFront":"處","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今天搭捷運參加演唱會的民眾很多，車上擠得都不能轉身。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-30","sourceFront":"轉身","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L05-1-27\",\"只要\",\"只要\",\"只要\",\"Conj\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"只要我有空，就去球場打球。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L05-1-27","sourceFront":"只要","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我住的社區有一座游泳池，只要有空我就會去游泳。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L05-1-25","sourceFront":"游泳池","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這個房子又大又舒服，房租只要三千塊，真是太便宜了！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L05-2-22","sourceFront":"真是","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"便利商店不遠，從我家過去只要五分鐘。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-44","sourceFront":"過去","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"你只要身體動一動，就不覺得冷了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-1-10","sourceFront":"動","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在這家餐廳吃飯，只要滿兩千塊，就送一盤水果。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-11","sourceFront":"滿","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"哥哥只要睡前喝太多水，就會夢到半夜起床找不到廁所，這樣的夢真可怕！","pinyin":"","english