":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-34","sourceFront":"放輕鬆","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"報名衝浪課的手續很簡單，只要到辦公室填一張基本資料表就行了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-28","sourceFront":"表","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每個人一輩子都會遇到像沒考上大學、找不到工作那樣的挫折，但只要努力就有希望。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-03","sourceFront":"挫折","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"只要你堅持每天學習一個小時的中文，我保證你的程度一定會越來越好的","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-07","sourceFront":"堅持","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每個人都有夢想，只要不怕挑戰、堅持到底，就能夢想成真。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-08","sourceFront":"到底","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每個人心中都有理想的交友條件，比如年齡幾歲以下，身高幾公分以上，但我只要對方愛我就好了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-17","sourceFront":"以上","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"只要照溫老師安排的課程，多閱讀、多練習，你的中文就會有很大的進步。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-03","sourceFront":"進步","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我父親是個警察，只要他負責的小組有重要任務時，就得出差一兩個星期。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-22","sourceFront":"任務","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"學生：明天就要大學考試了，我很緊張，怕考不好。 老師：你是很優秀的學生，我相信只要盡自己的能力，好好發揮實力，一定沒問題的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-2-20","sourceFront":"盡","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那家店的門是自動的，只要站到門前就會自動打開","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-08","sourceFront":"自動","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我每天睡覺前都會把明天的早餐預備好，這樣一起床只要加熱就能吃了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-17","sourceFront":"預備","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"只要打開手機，連上網路，就能立刻掌握全球新